# --- Node deps anywhere
**/node_modules/

# --- Local env files
.env
.env.*

# --- Logs & archives
*.log
*.zip

# --- Editor / temp
.vscode/
.tmp/

# --- Backups & diagnostics
_backup/
_backups/
_clean/
_diag_bundle/

# --- Runtime data (do NOT track). Keep seed data + README so folders exist.

# Basketball app data
Basketball/data/**
!Basketball/data/_seed/**
!Basketball/data/README.md

# Soccer app data (future-proof — same pattern)
Soccer/data/**
!Soccer/data/_seed/**
!Soccer/data/README.md
